<title>USA: Microlytics directors resign, only 1 left.</title>
<headline>Microlytics directors resign, only 1 left.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSFORD, N.Y. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Microlytics Inc said late Friday, after the market closed, that Donald Riley and Robert Harris have resigned as directors of the company.</p>
<p>The company said its sole remaining director is Elroy Roelke, who holds 15 percent of the company's common stock.</p>
</text>
